    18	
    19	| Method | Path | Notes |
    20	|---|---|---|
    21	| GET | `/items/` | Superusers see all items; everyone else sees only their own. Paginated (`skip`/`limit`), ordered by `created_at desc`. |
    22	| GET | `/items/{id}` | 404 if missing, 403 if not owner and not superuser. |
    23	| POST | `/items/` | `owner_id` is forced to `current_user.id` server-side — not settable by the client. |
    24	| PUT | `/items/{id}` | Partial update (`exclude_unset`); same 404/403 ownership rules as GET. |
    25	| DELETE | `/items/{id}` | Same ownership rules. |
