    14	
    15	# Frontend
    16	
    17	React 19 + TypeScript SPA, built with Vite. Entry: `frontend/src/main.tsx`.
    18	
    19	## Stack
    20	
    21	- **Routing**: [TanStack Router](https://tanstack.com/router), file-based — files
    22	  under `frontend/src/routes/` become routes; `frontend/src/routeTree.gen.ts` is
    23	  generated from them, do not hand-edit.
    24	- **Server state**: TanStack Query (`@tanstack/react-query`).
    25	- **UI components**: Radix UI primitives + `class-variance-authority`/`clsx`
    26	  (shadcn/ui style), under `frontend/src/components/`.
    27	- **API client**: `frontend/src/client/` — generated from the backend's OpenAPI schema,
    28	  never hand-edited. See `../../SKILL.md` for how to regenerate it.
    29	- **Tests**: Playwright (`bun run test`).
    30	
    31	## Routes (`frontend/src/routes/`)
    32	
    33	| File | Path |
    34	|---|---|
    35	| `login.tsx` | `/login` |
    36	| `signup.tsx` | `/signup` |
    37	| `recover-password.tsx` | `/recover-password` |
    38	| `reset-password.tsx` | `/reset-password` |
    39	| `_layout.tsx` + `_layout/index.tsx` | `/` (authenticated shell) |
    40	| `_layout/items.tsx` | `/items` |
    41	| `_layout/admin.tsx` | `/admin` |
    42	| `_layout/settings.tsx` | `/settings` |
    43	
    44	## Build
    45	
    46	`bun run build` runs `tsc -p tsconfig.build.json && vite build`. In production, the
    47	built output is served by the [backend](backend.md), not by a separate frontend
    48	container — see
    49	[deployment/topology](../deployment/topology.md).

